WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
OD Condor Spire hits with no Wind stocks.

2
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.150
Ryu falls from the ordinary OD Spire.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.850
Lily closes with two dashes and a short forward walk.

4
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:04.250
Heavy Mexican Typhoon catches the recorded wakeup action.

5
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:05.250
The heavy command throw reaches its ground impact.

6
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:06.350
Ryu remains down after heavy Typhoon.
